# The verification outputs are UTF-8 Chinese text. Git's binary heuristic
# misreads them, which would store them as opaque blobs and make the committed
# evidence undiffable in review. Mark the text-like paths explicitly.
# No working-tree-encoding is set: these files are already UTF-8 on disk, and
# re-encoding would add a BOM that the verification scripts would then read.
*.txt text
*.json text
*.md text
*.py text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
